    "chunk_text": "Supporting these capabilities is a state-of-the-art manufacturing facility complemented by a high-end in-house laboratory designed to conduct rigorous electrical, mechanical and fire-performance testing. The laboratory validates raw materials, semi-finished products and finished cables before dispatch, ensuring compliance with both national and international standards. Specialised testing facilities allow Sierra to conduct vertical flame propagation testing for individual and bunched cables, measure smoke density and analyse corrosive gas emissions. Fire-resistance testing is also conducted under combined fire, water and mechanical shock conditions in accordance with BS 6387, verifying a cable\u2019s ability to maintain circuit integrity in extreme emergency scenarios.\n\nSustainability is embedded within Sierra\u2019s operating philosophy. The company has received 4-Star Green Labelled Product certification from the Green Building Council of Sri Lanka under its Green Labelling System for sustainable building materials. It has also been recognised at the Presidential Environment Awards for excellence in environmental sustainability, reflecting strong environmental governance and responsible manufacturing practices.\n\nThe company\u2019s products continue to power many of Sri Lanka\u2019s most significant infrastructure developments. Among them are Cinnamon Life at City of Dreams, Tri-Zen Apartments, Cressida Resort Apartments & Residencies, Oceana Beach Resort Apartments & Villas and the Thambuttegama Water Supply Project. These projects represent the kind of complex developments where reliability and safety are non-negotiable \u2014 and where Sierra\u2019s technical credibility is trusted."
  },
