    "chunk_text": "The company\u2019s products continue to power many of Sri Lanka\u2019s most significant infrastructure developments. Among them are Cinnamon Life at City of Dreams, Tri-Zen Apartments, Cressida Resort Apartments & Residencies, Oceana Beach Resort Apartments & Villas and the Thambuttegama Water Supply Project. These projects represent the kind of complex developments where reliability and safety are non-negotiable \u2014 and where Sierra\u2019s technical credibility is trusted.\n\nSierra Cables PLC enters the next phase of its journey with momentum and clarity. Record financial performance, exclusive UL 44 certification, access to the United States market, expanding international operations and sustained investment in innovation position the company to deepen its leadership in the industry.\n\nIn an increasingly competitive global manufacturing environment, credibility matters. Standards matter. Trust matters. Sierra Cables is building all three."
